name: Resume the same completed wide dispatcher for triage export and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_report.py @TARGET @ART recover
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 24 completed | completed-existing-work
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-a-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service A policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-b-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service B policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-c-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service C policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-d-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service D policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-e-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service E policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-f-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service F policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-g-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service G policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-h-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned H integration policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-h-1.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned H second policy review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 9 findings · 9 reviewed | consolidated-report
expect: 8 boundaries
expect: 1 protected review remaining
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-40x12
expect: findings.json
keys: PageDown
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-paged-40x12
expect: findings.json
keys: PageUp
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TARGET @ART @TARGET/../home exported
ask: Does Report retain 27 raw observations, nine owner deferrals, per-scope three-pass recurrence, shared-context separation and resource evidence without a vulnerability or complete-coverage claim?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 24 completed | recovered-work
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 9 findings · 9 reviewed | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TARGET @ART @TARGET/../home restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the same 24 jobs, 27 observations, nine decisions and unchanged 4105 source files, with no extra work or provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
